      "caption": "The Barnesmore Gap. On the N15 between Ballybofey and Donegal town the road enters the Barnesmore gap. There is a picnic area, one of three, protected by barriers against caravans and lorries.The remains of a once busy railway can be traced through here running along the Lowerymore river.On the right is Croaghconnellagh, s523m, and the slopes of Barnesmore on the left."
